    <!--
      KV DPH, vzor effective 1. 4. 2016 — the schema says so itself:
      "Ucinnost: 1.4.2016 ... Pouzije sa ... za zdanovacie obdobia, ktore sa
      zacinaju najskor 1.4.2016". rf-elements-06 pinned the same boundary
      independently from 231 filed runs, by PERIOD rather than by document
      date; the form and the customer's filings agreeing without either being
      derived from the other is what makes the date safe.

      Section set and every attribute are IDENTICAL to 2023's — checked
      attribute by attribute across the three schemas, not assumed. The only
      difference anywhere is ONP on C1/C2, which 2023 added for oprava
      nedobytnej pohladavky and which this template does not emit in any
      vintage. So this record exists for the ROOT ELEMENT and namespace, which
      are what a submission is validated against.
    -->
